  CPlay (beta)  - Fast Console Audio Player
  Release Date  : October 2026
  Author        : Y. Dalissier
  Platform      : Windows All
  Audio Engine  : BASS 2.3 (MP3 & FLAC)
==============================================================================

  [ RELEASE NOTES ]
  CPlay is a lightning-fast console audio player crafted specifically
  for retro enthusiasts and clean-code purists. Built from the ground
  up in IWBasic 2.5, it features a custom dependency-free memory parser 
  for ID3v1, ID3v2, Vorbis comments, completely bypassing external DLLs.

  [ KEY FEATURES ]
  * Audio Support     : Native MP3 & FLAC streaming via BASS engine with 
                        wildcard queueing and relative/absolute M3U parsing.
  * International Text: Universal UTF-8 to OEM codepage transcoding and 
                        signed-byte masking ensuring flawless rendering of 
                        accents (Ã©, Ã , Ãª).
  * Memory-Safe Text  : Pointer-based stack buffers (8KB) bypassing the 
                        native 255-character string limitation for full 
                        scrolling comments and lyrics (lines 17-22).
  * Visual Interface  : GDI+ cover art extraction (side-by-side display), 
                        dynamic color themes (Retro, Matrix, Amber CRT), 
                        and real-time VU meters.
  * Ergonomics        : Arrow layout (Up/Down for volume, 
                        Left/Right for seeking).

